{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Isopod</strong> is a roly poly platforming adventure from the wonderful world of <strong>Webbed</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Expressive Physics Platforming!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2053910/extras/fast_roll_small.gif?t=1740138598\" />Roll up and smash your way through the undergrowth as a bouncy little wrecking ball! The <strong>Fire Ant Conglomerate </strong>won't know what hit 'em!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Magnet Drive!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2053910/extras/remove_heavy_metals_small.gif?t=1740138598\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A <strong>cool ant</strong> strapped a magnet to your back! Use it to swing through the air, catch flying cannonballs, and zip down powerlines... or just remove heavy metals from the soil - that's an isopod's job after all. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Isopod Skins!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2053910/extras/skins_small.gif?t=1740138598\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find trinkets and trade them for unique shells, both real and fantastical!\u00a0<strong>Be the isopod that you want to be!</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2053910?t=1740138598","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2053910/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1740138598","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2053910/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740138598","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2053910/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1740138598","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Isopod</strong> is a roly poly platforming adventure from the wonderful world of <strong>Webbed</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Expressive Physics Platforming!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2053910/extras/fast_roll_small.gif?t=1740138598\" />Roll up and smash your way through the undergrowth as a bouncy little wrecking ball! The <strong>Fire Ant Conglomerate </strong>won't know what hit 'em!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Magnet Drive!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2053910/extras/remove_heavy_metals_small.gif?t=1740138598\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A <strong>cool ant</strong> strapped a magnet to your back! Use it to swing through the air, catch flying cannonballs, and zip down powerlines... or just remove heavy metals from the soil - that's an isopod's job after all. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Isopod Skins!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2053910/extras/skins_small.gif?t=1740138598\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find trinkets and trade them for unique shells, both real and fantastical!\u00a0<strong>Be the isopod that you want to be!</strong></p>","developers":["Sbug Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2053910/header.jpg?t=1740138598","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</